    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.yarcplayhouse.com/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BRENT BUTT Live in Yarmouth"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Thursday April 9th &amp; Friday April 10th, 2026 @ 7:30pm Tickets $56 (plus service fees) Brent Butt has long been considered one of the funniest people in Canada, with a career in stand-up comedy that stretches into five decades, including numerous appearances at major festivals in multiple countries and being voted Best Male Stand-Up in Canada by his peers in the profession. He also created and starred in two successful sitcoms – CORNER GAS (“Funniest Show on TV” as voted by TV Guide Readers, seen in 60 countries) and HICCUPS (multiple Leo and Writers Guild Awards)."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.yarcplayhouse.com/temporary/e2cd91cc-f460-4c13-8186-04638672ea0c",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
